/// <c>.hint</c>, and <c>{action}.return.{result}.label</c> and <c>.hint</c>.
/// </summary>
/// <remarks>
/// The catalogue once carried this text itself, which meant the same sentence lived in a data file
/// for English and in a table for Chinese, and a new field could ship with only one of the two. Both
