        ["input.mouseMove.style.label"] = "Movement",
        ["input.mouseMove.style.hint"] = "How the pointer travels. A bent path bows out of the straight line; a hand-like one bows, drifts slightly and eases in and out, so the move does not look like a machine drew it. A bent path is travelled rather than jumped, so an instant move borrows 200 ms to have somewhere to bend.",
